  = note: two axes broadcast when their types are the same, or one of them is `U1`
  = help: the trait `BroadcastDim<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>>` is not implemented for `UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>`
          but it is implemented for `UInt<UTerm, B1>`
  = help: for that trait implementation, expected `UTerm`, found `UInt<UTerm, B1>`
  = note: required for `(UInt<UTerm, B1>, UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>)` to implement `BroadcastShape<(UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>, UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>)>`
